==Strategy==
Do whatever it takes to get rid of [[Bore]] as soon as possible. Use [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|status effect]] cats, like [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Pirate Cat]], [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Witch Cat]] and [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Apple Cat]]. [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and/or [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]] are effective attackers against the Bore.

Once you defeat Bore, [[Director Kurosawah]] and [[THE SLOTH]]s are easy. Just use Whale Cats, [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cats]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]], and you will most likely win the battle. Needless to say, the higher the level of the cats, the better.

==Trivia==
*According to the Japanese name of this stage, the "One-Piece" is in fact a one-piece swimsuit.
*Prior to [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]], THE SLOTH was considered a boss alongside Director Kurosawah.

